# AWFO — AWorldForYou

Immersive cinematic 3D web experience. NOT a typical Valentine's website.

## Architecture

- Read `docs/01-experience-architecture.md` before adding scenes or state
- All personal content in `src/data/experienceData.ts` only — never hardcode names/messages/images
- `App.tsx` mounts `<Experience />` only — max 30 lines
- Every scene registers via `SceneManager`, driven by `ExperiencePhase` enum

## Creative Rules

- NO generic pink romantic templates, floating heart spam, cheesy gradients
- NO HTML modals for memories — use `MemoryPortal` + scene transition
- NO "CLICK HERE" buttons — subtle glow/scale/light affordance only
- NO autoplay audio before `userHasInteracted === true`
- Visual hierarchy: composition → lighting → materials → camera → animation → post-processing

## Code Rules

- One milestone per session — do not implement multiple scenes at once
- No file > 300 lines — split into sub-components
- Scenes in `components/scenes/`, managers in `experience/`
- Placeholder assets (colored meshes) until final GLB ready
- TypeScript strict — types in `src/types/experience.types.ts`

## Performance

- Quality tiers: HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW via `useQualityTier`
- Mobile: no WASD, touch orbit, reduced post-processing
- Target 60fps desktop, 30fps stable mobile
- Instancing for repeated objects (trees, flowers, fireflies)

## Session Workflow

1. Read assigned `docs/phases/phase-N-*.md`
2. Implement acceptance criteria only
3. Test with `npm run dev`
4. Update `docs/TASKS-BREAKDOWN.md` checkbox
5. Add Agent Notes to phase plan file
